|                                                                             |
|Order of vertices is                                                         |
|{{0, 0, 0}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}, {0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 1}, {0, 1, 1}}           |
|Order of facets is                                                           |
|{{0, 2, 3, 5}, {0, 1, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 4, 5}, {0, 1, 2}, {3, 4, 5}}             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {0, 1, 2, 4}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : findFlag(V, Object => "matroid")                                        |
|                                                                             |
|Order of hyperplanes is                                                      |
|{{2, 3, 4, 5}, {0, 1, 4, 5}, {1, 3, 5}, {0, 3, 5}, {1, 2, 5}, {0, 2, 5}, {1, |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {0, 1, 5, 7}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : List                                                                    |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|3, 4}, {0, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 4}, {0, 2, 4}, {0, 1, 2, 3}}                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : findFlag({{0, 2, 3, 5}, {0, 1, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 4, 5}, {0, 1, 2}, {3, 4,   |
|Order of facets is                                                           |
|{{0, 2, 3, 5}, {0, 1, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 4, 5}, {0, 1, 2}, {3, 4, 5}}             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {0, 1, 2, 4}                                                            |
