    given polytope, cone or matroid with Plücker coordinates
  * *note symbolicSlackOfPlucker: symbolicSlackOfPlucker, -- fill the slack
    matrix with Plücker variables
  * *note grassmannSectionIdeal: grassmannSectionIdeal, -- compute the
    Grassmannian section ideal corresponding to a slack matrix

