grassmannSectionIdeal -- compute the Grassmannian section ideal corresponding to a slack matrix
***********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        I = grassmannSectionIdeal(S, B)
        I = grassmannSectionIdeal S
        I = grassmannSectionIdeal(V, B)
        I = grassmannSectionIdeal V
        I = grassmannSectionIdeal P
        I = grassmannSectionIdeal C
        I = grassmannSectionIdeal M
  * Inputs:
      * S, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, slack matrix
      * B, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, set of hyperplane spanning set
        indices
      * V, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, list of polytope vertex
        coordinates, cone generators, or matroid vectors
      * P, a *note convex polyhedron: (Polyhedra)Polyhedron,, a polytope
      * C, a *note convex rational cone: (Polyhedra)Cone,, a cone
      * M, a *note matroid: (Matroids)Matroid,, a matroid
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note CoefficientRing:
        grassmannSectionIdeal_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmCoefficientRing=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value QQ, specifies the coefficient ring of the underlying
        ring of the ideal
      * *note Object: grassmannSectionIdeal_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmObject=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
        => ..., default value "polytope", specify combinatorial object
      * *note Saturate: grassmannSectionIdeal_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmSaturate=>_pd_pd_pd
        _rp, => ..., default value "all", specifies saturation strategy to be
        used
      * *note Strategy: grassmannSectionIdeal_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd
        _rp, => ..., default value Eliminate, specifies saturation strategy to
        be used
  * Outputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, the Grassmannian section ideal
        corresponding to choice B of the object with slack matrix S

Description
===========

Given a slack matrix of a polytope, a cone or a matroid, or a set of polytope
vertices, cone generators, or matroid vectors, and a set of set of hyperplane
spanning set indices, it computes the Grassmannian section ideal corresponding
to choice B of the object with slack matrix S.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : V = {{0, 0}, {1, 0}, {2, 1}, {1, 2}, {0, 1}};                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : (VV, B) = getFacetBases V;                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I = grassmannSectionIdeal(VV, B)                                        |
|                                                                             |
|Order of vertices is                                                         |
|{{0, 0}, {1, 0}, {0, 1}, {2, 1}, {1, 2}}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = ideal (p     p      - p     p      + p     p     , p     p      -       |
|             1,2,4 0,3,4    0,2,4 1,3,4    0,1,4 2,3,4   1,2,3 0,3,4         |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     p     p      + p     p     , p     p      - p     p      + p     p     ,|
|      0,2,3 1,3,4    0,1,3 2,3,4   1,2,3 0,2,4    0,2,3 1,2,4    0,1,2 2,3,4 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     p     p      - p     p      + p     p     , p     p      - p     p      |
|      1,2,3 0,1,4    0,1,3 1,2,4    0,1,2 1,3,4   0,2,3 0,1,4    0,1,3 0,2,4 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     + p     p     )                                                         |
|        0,1,2 0,3,4                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of QQ[p     ..p     , p     , p     , p     , p     , p     , p   |
|                  0,1,2   0,1,3   0,2,3   1,2,3   0,1,4   0,2,4   1,2,4   0,3|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  , p     , p     ]                                                          |
|,4   1,3,4   2,3,4                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : V = {{0, 0}, {1, 0}, {2, 1}, {1, 2}, {0, 1}};                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : (VV, B) = getFacetBases V;                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : I = grassmannSectionIdeal(slackMatrix(VV), B)                           |
|                                                                             |
|Order of vertices is                                                         |
|{{0, 0}, {1, 0}, {0, 1}, {2, 1}, {1, 2}}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = ideal (p     p      - p     p      + p     p     , p     p      -       |
|             1,2,4 0,3,4    0,2,4 1,3,4    0,1,4 2,3,4   1,2,3 0,3,4         |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     p     p      + p     p     , p     p      - p     p      + p     p     ,|
|      0,2,3 1,3,4    0,1,3 2,3,4   1,2,3 0,2,4    0,2,3 1,2,4    0,1,2 2,3,4 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     p     p      - p     p      + p     p     , p     p      - p     p      |
|      1,2,3 0,1,4    0,1,3 1,2,4    0,1,2 1,3,4   0,2,3 0,1,4    0,1,3 0,2,4 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     + p     p     )                                                         |
|        0,1,2 0,3,4                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Ideal of QQ[p     ..p     , p     , p     , p     , p     , p     , p   |
|                  0,1,2   0,1,3   0,2,3   1,2,3   0,1,4   0,2,4   1,2,4   0,3|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  , p     , p     ]                                                          |
|,4   1,3,4   2,3,4                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

