************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        H = rehomogenizeIdeal(d, X)
        H = rehomogenizeIdeal(d, Y, T)
  * Inputs:
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, dimension of the polytope
      * X, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, a symbolic slack matrix X of
        a d-polytope
