        matrix Y of d-polytope
      * T, a *note graph: (EdgeIdeals)Graph,, spanning forest whose edges match
        the ones in Y
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Saturate: rehomogenizeIdeal_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmSaturate=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
