symbolicSlackMatrix(...,Object=>...) -- specify combinatorial object
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        symbolicSlackMatrix(..., Object => "polytope")
        symbolicSlackMatrix(..., Object => "matroid")
        symbolicSlackMatrix(..., Object => "abstractPolytope")

Description
===========

Indicates whether an input list should be treated as the vertices of a
polytope, the ground set of a matroid or the facets of an abstract polytope.

